> Same luck penalty applies for destroying the boulder (e.g. force bolt).

Luck penalty also applies to turning the boulder into meat (stone to
flesh), or changing the boulder with polymorph. The latter is
especially useless, since polymorphing a boulder just changes it into
another boulder!

Teleporting the boulder does NOT incur a luck penalty, but since it is
random it may put the boulder in an equally obstructing position.

Picking up the boulder while polymorphed into a giant DOES incur the
penalty. I also tried polymorphing myself into a Xorn, but on the
Sokoban levels one CANNOT phase through boulders as usual.


